OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie water disruption shows
OL,4,A'ageing' prison problems - watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's prison watchdog has warned
OL,7,Fissues with the water supply at the
OL,8,Fcountry's largest jail are a symptom of
OL,9,Fits ageing estate.
OL,11,FSome inmates were left unable to flush
OL,12,Ftoilets in their cells at HMP Barlinnie
OL,13,Fin Glasgow while others have had
OL,14,F"intermittent" access to hot water for
OL,15,Fseven days.
OL,17,FSara Snell, His Majesty's Chief
OL,18,FInspector of Prisons, said overcrowding
OL,19,Fat the jail had exacerbated existing
OL,20,Fproblems with "inadequate"
OL,21,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
