OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie water disruption shows
OL,4,A'ageing' prison problems - watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Prison Service (SPS) said
OL,7,Fwork to fix the issues was ongoing, but
OL,8,Fwas causing "disruption" in a small
OL,9,Fnumber of areas.
